sequenceDiagram
    participant Store as Event store
    participant Host as Execution host
    participant Engine as TurnEngine

    loop Until the turn finishes
        Host->>Store: 1. Load events
        Host->>Engine: 2. Replay state; prepare or apply
        Engine-->>Host: 3. Events + operation or outcome
        Host->>Store: 4. Append with expected version
        Host->>Host: 5. Execute now or schedule durably
    end
